// Five equal bars on a 3:5 field.
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "Multigender flag"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
  render-license "CC0-1.0"
  source "https://www.deviantart.com/pride-flags/art/Multigender-2-584880803"
  source "https://lgbtqia.fandom.com/wiki/Multigender"
  note "The designer and first publication were not found. The earliest copy read is 'Multigender (2)' by Pride-Flags on DeviantArt, published 2016-01-17 UTC (16 January, Pacific time), whose credit reads 'Designed by: [Deactivated]', so the designer's account no longer exists. The post gives no meanings; the LGBTQIA+ Wiki (Fandom) says the creator and meanings are unknown and the design was in use by 16 January 2016."
  note "Construction and colors are read from that post's image (5000 by 3000 PNG), which is not shown to be the designer's: five bars of 601, 600, 598, 600 and 601 pixels, taken as equal, #3f47cc, #00a3e8, #fb7f27, #00a3e8, #3f47cc. The 3:5 proportion is the image's."
}
palette {
  indigo "#3f47cc"
  blue "#00a3e8"
  orange "#fb7f27"
}
proportion hoist=3 fly=5

bars indigo blue orange blue indigo
